# SPARK guard build artifacts (mempalace/guard/spark/) — gnatprove proof
# cache + gprbuild intermediates are regenerated by `gnatprove`/`gprbuild`
# and should never be committed. lib/libguard.dll IS intentionally vendored
# (Windows users can't easily install the Alire/GNAT toolchain to rebuild
# it themselves) — only its compiler-intermediate siblings (.ali, obj/) are
# excluded here, not the whole lib/ directory.
mempalace/guard/spark/obj/
mempalace/guard/spark/lib/*.ali
*.o
*.ali
*.sarif
why3session.xml
why3shapes
